# Track the agent skill/agent suites (re-include from the `.claude/` rule above).
# A file can't be re-included while its parent dir is excluded, so: re-include
# .claude/ itself, re-ignore its other children (settings.local.json, session
# state, ...), then re-include exactly the two shipped subtrees + their contents.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/agents/**
